+- Choose your preferred translation method:
+  - **AI Translate module prompts**: Requires the AI Translate sub-module to be
+    enabled and configured, plus a default chat provider configured in AI settings.
+    Uses AI Translate's sophisticated per-language prompts via direct chat interface,
+    completely bypassing provider-specific translation methods.
+  - **AI provider translation interface**: Requires a provider that supports the
